## 9. Project Limitations

1. The CNN achieved lower test accuracy than the traditional machine learning models.
2. The CNN learning curves indicated overfitting.
3. The CNN used spectrogram images, whereas Random Forest and SVM used extracted numerical audio features.
4. Random Forest and SVM aggregated predictions from multiple audio segments per song, while the CNN classified one spectrogram image per song. Therefore, the comparison is at song level but uses different input representations and prediction aggregation strategies.
5. The experiment used the GTZAN dataset, so the results may not generalise to every music collection or recording environment.

